# OpenClaw maestro-flow-review-agent: daily scheduled Maestro flow review.
# Cron is UTC; runs at 03:00 UTC daily — an hour before the 04:00 UTC OAuth
# refresh (and its ~30-95s gateway downtime), so no overlap. The wrapper
# enforces the 12h manual-run suppression gate and posts one message per
# tick (heartbeat model): findings, "✓ ran — 0 findings", "⏸ suppressed",
# or "⚠ run FAILED". A missing message at ~03:05 UTC means the cron or host failed.
#
# Deployed to: /etc/cron.d/openclaw-maestro-review (root:root, mode 644).
0 3 * * * openclaw /home/openclaw/.openclaw/scripts/maestro-review-cron.sh
